            "value" : "Pot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Same car, under %lld min and %lld m apart. The merged trip keeps the first trip's start, type and purpose, and adds both distances plus the gap between them. A stop at a customer should stay a separate trip — untick it." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the criteria used to find split trips.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Same car, under %1$lld min and %2$lld m apart. The merged trip keeps the first trip's start, type and purpose, and adds both distances plus the gap between them. A stop at a customer should stay a separate trip — untick it."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isto vozilo, manj kot %1$lld min in %2$lld m narazen. Združena vožnja ohrani začetek, tip in namen prve vožnje ter sešteje obe razdalji in razmik med njima. Postanek pri stranki naj ostane ločena vožnja — odznačite ga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
